= BMFX Render Dispatcher =

Connect this LOP after the render-setting and render-pass nodes. The node is a
pass-through until a farm snapshot is prepared.

Press **Preflight Check** to inspect the AOVs, passes and read-only output paths
on the composed USD stage. Disable unwanted entries, set the Deadline farm
parameters and press **Dispatch to Farm**.

One filtered HIP snapshot and one Deadline job are created for each selected
render pass. Camera and resolution stay controlled by BMFX Render Setting.
